  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 — New: Remote API Explorer — browse and test a remote REST API from\n      its OpenAPI document via a server-side spec proxy that keeps credentials off the browser network\n      tab. New ApiTestSparkOptions properties: RemoteBaseUrl, RemoteOpenApiUrl, RemoteOpenApiApiKeyHeader,\n      RemoteOpenApiApiKeyValue, RemoteOpenApiBearerToken, RemoteDefaultHeaders. Header token expansion\n      ({session-guid}, {request-guid}). SSRF guard on proxy endpoint. Harness version and build date\n      on About page. HeadersEditor focus-loss fix. See CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
